                                                
         HARTREE-FOCK + BCS + QRPA CODE         
         BASED ON A SKYRME INTERACTION          
                                                
         -Authors: G. Colò and X. Roca-Maza     
         -Affiliation: UniMi and INFN (Milano)  
         -Date: July 9th 2020                   
         -Version: 1.0 (TESTING VERSION)        
         -Publication: Preliminary version      
                                                
  INPUT FILES:                                  
         - hfbcs-qrpa.in: set needed input info 
           to run the code for a given nucleus  
           interaction, etc. (see notes)        
                                                
         - param.qrpa: list of default          
           parameters                           
                                                
  OUTPUT FILES:                                 
         - hfbcs-qrpa.out: (THIS FILE) main     
           output of the code                   
                                                
         - quasiparticle_states.out: list of    
           states used for the calculation      
                                                
         - basis_states.out: list of two body   
           PP/NN configurations                 
                                                
         - d.out: proton and neutron densities  
                                                
         - td.out: proton and neutron transition
           densities for all states (large file)
                                                
         - strength_*.out: isoscalar, isovector 
           and electromagnetic strengths        
                                                
